Oh my God, my heart, I can't handle this.

00:01:19.725 --> 00:01:22.058
Aw, they're so scared of me.

00:01:28.426 --> 00:01:30.538
I've only seen them in pictures.

00:01:30.538 --> 00:01:31.688
Oh my God.

00:01:31.688 --> 00:01:32.866
- [Voiceover] Yes!

00:01:32.866 --> 00:01:34.057
